Licence of the tables (data) - not the licence of the code
==========================================================

The statistical tables and word lists of hebzip - the files in this folder, the same files inside the
website folder (site/tables/) and the tables archive published as a release download - are licensed under

    Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

They are adaptations of Hebrew Wikipedia, English Wikipedia and the fastText Hebrew word vectors (see
CREDITS.md for the sources, the attribution and the list of articles). They were MODIFIED: the source
texts and vectors were converted into word lists, word / letter / template counts, word classes and
neighbour lists; no source text is stored in them.

You may share and adapt them, also commercially, if you give the attribution in CREDITS.md, say that
you changed them (if you did), and share your adaptations under the same licence.

Exception: tables/latin_toy/ was built from a toy text written for this project
(langpacks/latin_toy/) and is under the MIT licence of the code (../LICENSE).

The code that reads these tables (hebzip/) is under the MIT licence (../LICENSE). Reading a table as
data does not make the code an adaptation of it; the two licences stay separate.
